+(NSMutableArray *) findnextlessonwithdatetime:(NSString *)datetime dayofweek:(NSString *)dayofweek schedulerecord:(ScheduleRecord *)schedulerecord nooflesson:(long)nooflesson includebasedate:(BOOL)includebasedate excludescheduleenddatecheck:(BOOL)exludescheduleenddatecheck manualselection:(BOOL)manualselection
{
    
    if(nooflesson==0){
        return nil;
    }
    
    //BOOL checkschedulestartdate;
    if ([datetime isEqualToString:@""]) {
        //checkschedulestartdate=YES;
        datetime=[MyClass convertToNSStringWithNSDate:[NSDate date] DateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"];
        
    }/*else{
        checkschedulestartdate=NO;
    }*/
    
    NSDate *base_date;
    NSDate *startdate;
    NSString *startdatestring;
    NSDate *startdatetime;
    NSString *startdatetimestring;
    NSDateFormatter *df=[[NSDateFormatter alloc]init];df.locale=[[NSLocale alloc]initWithLocaleIdentifier:@"en_US"];
    NSMutableArray *nextlessonarray=[[NSMutableArray alloc]init];
    
    //if (schedulerecord) {
    if ([schedulerecord.schedulekey isEqualToString:@"-2"]) {
        //return next working day
        NSDate *yesterday = [NSDate dateWithTimeIntervalSinceNow:-86400];
        return [[NSMutableArray alloc]initWithObjects:[[LessonRecord2 alloc]initLessonRecord2withdatetime:[MyClass findNextWorkDay2:yesterday includereserveddate:YES] instructor:nil classroom:nil level:nil sinstructor:nil],nil];

        
    }else if ([schedulerecord.schedulekey isEqualToString:@"-1"]){
        [df setDateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy"];
        base_date=[df dateFromString:[datetime substringToIndex:11]];
        long startingindex=[MyClass returnDateOffsetWithDate:base_date];
        
        for (long i=includebasedate?startingindex:startingindex+7; i<startingindex+3650; i=[dayofweek isEqualToString:@"Any"]?(i+1):(i+7)) {
            startdate=[df dateFromString:[MyClass returnDateFromBaseDateWithOffset:i]];
            
            if ([MyClass isWorkingDate:startdate includereserveddate:(nextlessonarray.count==0 && includebasedate && manualselection)]) {
                [nextlessonarray addObject:[[LessonRecord2 alloc]initLessonRecord2withdatetime:[MyClass returnDateFromBaseDateWithOffset:i] instructor:nil classroom:nil level:nil sinstructor:nil]];
                if (nextlessonarray.count==nooflesson) {
                    return nextlessonarray;
                }
            }
        }
    }else{
        if (schedulerecord.daytimearray.count>0) {
            ScheduleDetailsRecord *scheduledetailsobj;
            if(![schedulerecord.type isEqualToString:@"Fixed"]){
                //recursive schedule
                NSArray *allweekarray=[MyClass returnschedulearraywithschedulerecord:schedulerecord];
                
                if (allweekarray) {
                    [df setDateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"];
                    if ([datetime length]==11) {
                        datetime=[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@ 00:00",datetime];
                    }
                    base_date=[df dateFromString:datetime];
                    long startingindex=[MyClass returnDateOffsetWithDate:base_date];
                    
                    
                    for (long i=startingindex; i<startingindex+3650; i++) {
                        startdatestring=[MyClass returnDateFromBaseDateWithOffset:i];
                        startdate=[MyClass convertToNSDateWithDate:startdatestring DateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy"];
                        long weeknumber=[MyClass returndayofweeknumber:[MyClass returndayofweek:startdatestring]]-1;
                        
                        if ([MyClass isWorkingDate:startdate includereserveddate:NO]) {
                            for (int j=0; j<((NSMutableArray *)[allweekarray objectAtIndex:weeknumber]).count; j++) {
                                scheduledetailsobj=[((NSMutableArray *)[allweekarray objectAtIndex:weeknumber]) objectAtIndex:j];
                                startdatetimestring=[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@ %@",startdatestring,scheduledetailsobj.classtime];
                                startdatetime=[df dateFromString:startdatetimestring];
                                if ([schedulerecord.startdate isEqualToString:@""] || [startdatetime compare:[MyClass convertToNSDateWithDate:schedulerecord.startdate DateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy"]]!=NSOrderedAscending) {
                                    if ([startdatetime compare:base_date]==NSOrderedDescending || ([startdatetime compare:base_date]==NSOrderedSame && includebasedate)) {
                                        
                                        if (!exludescheduleenddatecheck && ![schedulerecord.enddate isEqualToString:@""] && [[MyClass convertToNSDateWithDate:[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@ 23:59",schedulerecord.enddate] DateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"] compare:startdatetime]==NSOrderedAscending) {
                                            return nextlessonarray;
                                        }else{
                                            //[nextlessonarray addObject:startdatetimestring];
                                            [nextlessonarray addObject:[[LessonRecord2 alloc]initLessonRecord2withdatetime:startdatetimestring instructor:scheduledetailsobj.instructor classroom:scheduledetailsobj.classroom level:nil sinstructor:scheduledetailsobj.sinstructor]];
                                            
                                            if (nextlessonarray.count>=nooflesson) {
                                                return nextlessonarray;
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }else{
                //Fixed schedule
                for (int i=0; i<schedulerecord.daytimearray.count; i++) {
                    scheduledetailsobj=[schedulerecord.daytimearray objectAtIndex:i];
                    startdatetimestring=[NSString stringWithFormat:@"%@ %@",scheduledetailsobj.dayofweek,scheduledetailsobj.classtime];
                    if ([[MyClass convertToNSDateWithDate:startdatetimestring DateFormat:@"yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm"] compare:[MyClass convertToNSDateWithDate:datetime DateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"]]!=NSOrderedAscending) {
                        [nextlessonarray addObject:[[LessonRecord2 alloc]initLessonRecord2withdatetime:[MyClass convertDateFormatWithDate:startdatetimestring FromDateFormat:@"yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm" ToDateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"] instructor:scheduledetailsobj.instructor classroom:scheduledetailsobj.classroom level:nil sinstructor:scheduledetailsobj.sinstructor]];
                    }
                    if(nextlessonarray.count>=nooflesson){
                        break;;
                    }
                }
                return nextlessonarray;
            }
        }
    }
    return nil;
}



+ (NSInteger) returnEndOfMonthwithCurrentDate:(NSDate *)currentdate
{
    NSDateFormatter *df=[[NSDateFormatter alloc]init];df.locale=[[NSLocale alloc]initWithLocaleIdentifier:@"en_US"];
    [df setDateFormat:@"yyyyMMdd"];
    NSCalendar * calendar = [NSCalendar currentCalendar];
    NSDateComponents *months=[[NSDateComponents alloc]init];
    [months setMonth:1];
    
    NSDate * plusOneMonthDate = [calendar dateByAddingComponents:months toDate:currentdate options:0];
    NSDateComponents * plusOneMonthDateComponents = [calendar components: NSCalendarUnitYear | NSCalendarUnitMonth fromDate: plusOneMonthDate];
    NSDate * endOfMonth = [[calendar dateFromComponents: plusOneMonthDateComponents] dateByAddingTimeInterval: -1];
    
    return [[df stringFromDate:endOfMonth] integerValue];
}

+(NSString *) convertYYYYMMDDHHMMtoDDMMMYYYYHHMMwithdate:(NSString *)datestring
{
    if ([datestring isEqualToString:@""] || !datestring) {
        return @"";
    }else{
        NSDateFormatter *df=[[NSDateFormatter alloc]init]; df.locale=[[NSLocale alloc]initWithLocaleIdentifier:@"en_US"];
        [df setDateFormat:@"yyyyMMddHHmm"];
        NSDate *date=[df dateFromString:datestring];
        [df setDateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"];
        return [df stringFromDate:date]?[df stringFromDate:date]:datestring;
    }
}

+(NSString *) convertYYYYMMDDHHMMtoDDMMMYYYYHHMMwithdatetime:(NSString *)datetimestring
{
    if ([datetimestring isEqualToString:@""] || !datetimestring) {
        return @"";
    }else{
        NSDateFormatter *df=[[NSDateFormatter alloc]init]; df.locale=[[NSLocale alloc]initWithLocaleIdentifier:@"en_US"];
        [df setDateFormat:@"yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm"];
        NSDate *date=[df dateFromString:datetimestring];
        [df setDateFormat:@"dd-MMM-yyyy HH:mm"];
        return [df stringFromDate:date]?[df stringFromDate:date]:datetimestring;
    }
}

